OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACall for government help over
OL,4,A'forever chemicals' site
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt follows an investigation by the
OL,7,FEnvironment Agency (EA) that found the
OL,8,Fcontamination is likely to have come
OL,9,Ffrom the nearby AGC Chemicals factory,
OL,10,Fwhich used it in their manufacturing
OL,11,Fprocesses until 2012.
OL,13,FAGC Chemicals said the site
OL,14,Fmanufactured chemicals long before the
OL,15,Fcompany was established and it cannot
OL,16,Fspeculate on future outcomes.
